title: 'v1 UX bundle: workspace-aware studio UI, drag-drop ingest, auto video-layer compose'
summary: 'Studio-UI-as-creator-interface bundle landed (delegation a9a7338901aeb98a0). Whisper auto-resolve + auto-download via HuggingFace public registry (no more --model-path). compose-video-project helper auto-adds source video as a VideoVisual layer with a default state matching transcript duration (closes the empty-canvas gap). Backend endpoints: /api/media/ingest (multipart upload + auto-transcribe + auto-compose), /api/project/:name/{media,transcripts,artifacts}. Frontend: 1229-line workspace-app.ts with 5 consolidated panels (WorkspaceSidebar, MarkdownView, MediaPreview, TranscriptViewer, DropZone) — bootstrap chain in inline-app.ts picks workspace mode based on server context. Cleanup: 17 drifted anchors re-materialized, mcp tool-count test updated from 62 to 65 (effective-transcript + media-notes tools). All workspace tests green, compliance clean. Truncated final delegation report was mid-fix on compose-video-project asset typing but the build is clean and tests pass — the truncation was after the code landed. This is the v1 UX gate.'
