learnings:
  - The 5-panel UI was consolidated into one workspace-app.ts (1229 lines) rather than separate panel files — the right call given session-scoped panels don't need a separate publish cycle from the studio package.
  - auto-add-video-layer-on-ingest closes the empty-canvas gap from the prior test (caption layers existed but no source video layer, so canvas showed nothing). compose-video-project is the helper both the CLI media-ingest and the new HTTP endpoint call into.
  - Whisper auto-resolve via HuggingFace registry means creators never type --model-path. First-use download is one-shot; cached forever. Per TD-2026-05-27-723, no runtime online dependency.
